  "rules": [
    "IDs are stable; retired2,3,56 are not reassigned. No activation/grant switch for Web control.",
    "CONFIG only accepts numeric actions; no arbitrary invocation. Prefix4 bytes are reserved zero in EX01v7.",
    "Requests remain10bytes: reserved0:u32LE,op:u8,action:u8,value:i32LE;op0 read/op1 write.",
    "Writes require stopped outputs, no EEPROM write and no Hall measurement; no lease/token or OLED enable.",
    "RAM editing is separate from explicit EEPROM save/discard; Hall calibration remains local OLED.",
    "Context wheel/IR channel is shared; ENCODER_STEPS only2or4."
  ],
